# 0207 — SearchResults grouped navigable hits

## Mission

Grouped, navigable search results for files, logs, objects, commands, and
documentation: groups, match ranges, snippets, source metadata, status,
pagination/streaming, selection, preview, open. Keep matched text visible under
truncation. Next/previous match and group collapse. Stale async searches and
cancellation. Compose with SearchInput, QuickOpen, and FullscreenViewer.

Research: ripgrep UIs, IDE search, fzf previews, documentation search.

## Preserve / migrate / split / delete

| Surface | Fate |
|---------|------|
| `SearchInput` | **Preserved** — host owns query bar; results are separate surface |
| `HighlightedText` / `MatchRange` / `MatchTruncate` | **Preserved** — paint match spans + keep-match truncate |
| `QuickOpen` | **Preserved** — `search_results_to_quick_open` bridge |
| `FullscreenViewer` | **Preserved** — `FullscreenRequested` outcome |
| `List` / `VirtualList` | **Preserved** — general lists; SearchResults owns group+match UX |
| Search I/O / ripgrep / index | **Never in TermRock** — host generation + apply_results |
| `SearchResults*` | **Added** |

## Consumer API sketch

```rust
use termrock::widgets::{
    SearchResults, SearchResultsState, SearchResultGroup, SearchResultItem,
    SearchResultKind, SearchResultsStatus, MatchRange, SearchInput,
    flatten_search_results, search_results_to_quick_open,
};

// Host: SearchInput debounce → start search
let gen = results.begin_search();
// async work… then:
results.apply_results(gen, SearchResultsStatus::Ready { total: Some(n) }, page.len());
// if gen outdated → Stale chrome

let groups = [SearchResultGroup::new("src", "src/", 2)];
let items = [
    SearchResultItem::new("1", "main.rs")
        .group("src")
        .source("src/main.rs")
        .snippet("fn main() { search(); }")
        .title_matches(&[MatchRange::new(0, 4)])
        .line(12),
];
SearchResults::new(&groups, &items, &system).title("find").render(area, buf, &mut results);

let flat = flatten_search_results(&groups, &items, &results.collapsed);
match results.handle_key(&flat, &items, key) {
    OpenRequested { id } => { /* open file */ }
    MatchWalk { id, in_snippet, .. } => { /* focus match */ }
    CancelSearch => { /* abort async */ }
    FullscreenRequested { id } => { /* FullscreenViewer */ }
    QuickOpenRequested => { search_results_to_quick_open(&items) }
    _ => {}
}
```

### Keys

| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| j/k · arrows · page · home/end | Navigate flat list |
| Enter | Open item / toggle group |
| Space | Preview item / toggle group (or multi-check) |
| n / N | Next / previous match |
| ] [ · Ctrl+N/P | Page next/prev |
| Esc | Cancel loading/partial search |
| r · Enter | Retry error / refresh stale |
| Ctrl+O · Ctrl+Shift+F | QuickOpen · fullscreen |
| h/l | Collapse/expand group |

